\newlabel{tab:main}{{1}{6}{Error-detection AUROC on Dataset E (R\textsubscript {AB}, $n = 2{,}686$). PEER+TEXT combines consensus with text-based checks. S4 is a cross-fitted stack of 28 baselines including all judges, round-trip, and self-consistency. Stratified AUROC restricts pairs to the same source stratum}{table.1}{}}
